    871  f102							; either; case15 filters zero writes so the Y-align guard is unaffected.
    872  f102							; --- Scanlines this pass: rows 0/1 = 48; row 2 = 36+off (tide, CollisionX).
    873  f102							; The bottom water strip (last 12-off lines, bottom_band_plan rule 2)
