   1208  f206							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1209  f206							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1210  f206							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1211  f206							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1212  f206							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1213  f206							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
