   2108  f604							; --- Player sprites: 8x12, all 8 pixels wide (bit7 = leftmost pixel) ---
   2109  f604							; Frame A = normal, frame B = jet legs (rows 7-8 differ; 3 pixels changed).
   2110  f604							; Per-row colors in PlayerColTable (RED/RED/YELLOW/RED/GRAY/RED/.../BLACK/BLACK).
