   2428  f76e							; Slot1Hook — called from the .Row setup (X = RowIdx = band). Swaps the live
   2429  f76e							; trio when slot 1 lives in this band, then repositions P1 and strobes HMOVE
   2430  f76e							; on the following line's HBLANK. Preserves X (RowIdx) and Y (running-Y: the
