   2801  f97a							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2802  f97a							; RefreshEnemyY moved post-pad (after TitleWork) — 2026-10-02, so its SELECT
   2803  f97a							; → title check costs 0 pre-pad bytes (headroom 1B). Pins .ds $FBF8/$FC49
   2804  f97a							; keep every downstream pre-pad address unchanged.
