   3458  fc8d							;   caller's return. Full behavior docs moved with the body.
   3459  fc8d							;   Behavior: if the player's proposed tile range (CollisionCell*) overlaps
   3460  fc8d							;   any hot-only rect, set Temp bit 7 (HotBump), called from PlayerHitsMap
