   4311  ffa7		       e6 c0		      inc	LaserState	; b0 rearm: next held frame re-tests the eye
   4312  ffa9							; (b0 was 0: travel only runs with b0 clear,
   4313  ffa9							; rearm dec'd it before this init) — flush
