   4372  fff2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4373  fff2							; LaserHitTest — MOVED to bank2 (S5.4, entry tramp $FE86 -> `jmp $FF00`).
   4374  fff2							;   Fold-free: enemy records are level data in bank2 (direct (FetchPtr),Y),
   4375  fff2							;   and the kill/lamp ACTIONS cannot run from a bank2 body (CallPads are
   4376  fff2							;   bank0->bank1 only — pads cannot nest from a pad body). Body returns a
   4377  fff2							;   RESULT CODE in A (+Z preserved through ReturnPad's sta/rts): 0 = miss,
   4378  fff2							;   #$50 = kill (dead bit already set), 1 = lamp. LaserInput's tail does
   4379  fff2							;   `beq / cmp #$50 / jsr CallPad_SetRoomDark | jsr CallPad_AddScore`.
   4380  fff2							;   One less push level too (no fold / no pad call inside the body).
   4381  fff2							;   Full behavior docs moved with the body.
   4382  fff2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
